{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Great Circle Map 是一款專為航空與地理愛好者設計的交互式地球儀 App。不同於傳統地圖應用，它採用四元數弧球技術，讓使用者能無視南北極限制，任意方向拖曳旋轉檢視地球。目前該應用在 App Store 提供限時免費下載，原價為 US $0.99，是探索大圓航線與全球天氣的優質工具。</p>\n\n<h2>自由旋轉檢視大圓航線</h2>\n<p>輸入兩個機場代碼即可繪製最短大圓路徑，並顯示距離與方位角。支援添加無限航點以查看即時天氣數據，包括溫度與風速。內建 NASA 藍 Marble 或 Natural Earth 影像模式，可切換投影方式並將路線匯出分享，全程無追蹤分析，隱私保護完善。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-44-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-45-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-46-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Great Circle Map</li>\n<li>應用類別：Navigation</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T20:39:04.948651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}